.TH "Docv::Style" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Style \- A text rendition: attributes plus foreground and background color, and the markup of the text (not written to the terminal).
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBstruct Docv::Style\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
A text rendition: attributes plus foreground and background color, and
the markup of the text (not written to the terminal).
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(attr : Attr = Attr::None, fg : Color = Color::DEFAULT, bg : Color = Color::DEFAULT, markup : Markup = Markup::None)\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef add(extra : Attr) : Style\fR
Returns a copy with \fIextra\fR attributes added.
.PP
\fBdef attr : Attr\fR
.PP
\fBdef bg : Color\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef colors(fg : Color, bg : Color) : Style\fR
Returns a copy with different colors.
.PP
\fBdef fg : Color\fR
.PP
\fBdef markup : Markup\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef merge(over : Style) : Style\fR
Returns this style with \fIover\fR on top: attributes combined, each color
and the markup replaced where \fIover\fR has one.
.TP 4
\fBdef to_sgr(io : IO) : Nil\fR
Writes the SGR sequence selecting this rendition from a reset state.
